{
  "source": "Prompts/trust-trap-1.mp4",
  "duration": 192.563125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.84,
      "text": "We all know artificial intelligence is incredibly capable."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.46,
      "end": 9.3,
      "text": "It can write code, pass medical exams, and draft entire business plans in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.28,
      "end": 13.9,
      "text": "But when you stand at a crossroads, facing a high-stakes life decision,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 16.98,
      "text": "how much should you trust an algorithm to guide you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.78,
      "end": 20.84,
      "text": "Take a universally stressful choice, like picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.5,
      "end": 25.84,
      "text": "Your final destination depends entirely on the quality of the map you used to get there,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.08,
      "end": 28.14,
      "text": "and more importantly, who drew it."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.84,
      "end": 32.02,
      "text": "Let's test this by asking the exact same question twice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.7,
      "end": 35.52,
      "text": "once at the dinner table and once in a chat window."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.34,
      "end": 38.18,
      "text": "This comparison graphic illustrates the difference."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.94,
      "end": 43.04,
      "text": "On the left side, your mom says, Indiana, you seemed more comfortable there,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.42,
      "end": 45.44,
      "text": "and when you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.12,
      "end": 49.38,
      "text": "Being somewhere you'll ask for help matters more for you than another ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.34,
      "end": 51.9,
      "text": "The truth below highlights why."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.64,
      "end": 56.12,
      "text": "She actually knows you and holds a personal stake in your future happiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.8,
      "end": 57.82,
      "text": "Now shift right."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.6,
      "end": 60.14,
      "text": "The chatbot responds, Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.84,
      "end": 63.6,
      "text": "It offers world-class academics in a vibrant campus community."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 65.42,
      "text": "It could be an excellent fit for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.22,
      "end": 67.26,
      "text": "The truth here is colder."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 72.42,
      "text": "It only knows you're prompt, has never seen you stuck, and has zero stakes in your choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.26,
      "end": 74.68,
      "text": "Both sources give you an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.2,
      "end": 77.8,
      "text": "Only one possesses actual context about your life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.3,
      "end": 80.74,
      "text": "and will live with the real-world consequences of your choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.74,
      "end": 82.82,
      "text": "Look at those two answers again."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.42,
      "end": 85.12,
      "text": "Which one would you instinctively trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.12,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "The AI's response is confident, highly polished, and incredibly easy to like."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.68,
      "end": 95.08,
      "text": "But read it closely, and you realize it is completely generic."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.9,
      "end": 99.48,
      "text": "It could have been generated for almost any student, anywhere in the country."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.28,
      "end": 103.7,
      "text": "We fall into a cognitive blind spot called the Trust Trap."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.34,
      "end": 107.66,
      "text": "We end up giving a human-sounding generic text output"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.66,
      "end": 112.36,
      "text": "the exact same level of trust we normally reserve for someone who actually knows us."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.36,
      "end": 116.84,
      "text": "Mistaking generic confidence for genuine personal understanding"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.84,
      "end": 120.38,
      "text": "leaves us incredibly vulnerable right when we need real guidance."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.36,
      "end": 123.04,
      "text": "The reason we fall for this is biological."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.02,
      "end": 128.5,
      "text": "When an AI uses first-person pronouns, like I think or I feel,"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.9,
      "end": 131.3,
      "text": "our brain registers a real person speaking."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 135.5,
      "text": "And when a system responds to you, your brain automatically goes to work"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.5,
      "end": 138.06,
      "text": "searching for a personality behind the screen."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.06,
      "end": 143.16,
      "text": "That feeling of being understood by an algorithm is a neat biological trick"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.16,
      "end": 144.42,
      "text": "played by your own mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.84,
      "end": 146.78,
      "text": "It is not a feature coded into the software."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.5,
      "end": 151.96,
      "text": "AI is an excellent tool for gathering facts, organizing complex options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.42,
      "end": 156.06,
      "text": "and even challenging your initial assumptions based on the data you feed it."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.64,
      "end": 160.6,
      "text": "But processing data is completely different from shared human experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.22,
      "end": 166.44,
      "text": "A mentor understands your history and shares the burden of living with the outcome of your choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.44,
      "end": 169.84,
      "text": "So, use the chatbots to do your research."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.56,
      "end": 171.96,
      "text": "Let them lay out the pros and cons."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.82,
      "end": 177.98,
      "text": "But before you finalize a major life choice, talk it through with the people who actually know you."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.7,
      "end": 180.18,
      "text": "Take a look at this final banner."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.66,
      "end": 182.2,
      "text": "It perfectly summarizes the rule."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.14,
      "end": 185.62,
      "text": "Sounding human doesn't make AI human."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.4,
      "end": 188.82,
      "text": "For important decisions, talk to people who know you."
    }
  ],
